Node ID=1 too late
Text=<She does not rise from the reliquary's step. Two of the creatures coil at her feet; a third, older, stands behind her with its hands folded.> You are late, Lionheart. The Master has what he came for, and I have what I was left to do. I had wagons for this once, and sisters I could spare. You have spent both on your way in.
