Node ID=1 delivered
Text=You walked in. Good. It saves rope. He wants you whole, and north, and I have no wagons left and no sisters I can spare to walk you over the mountains. I have been sitting on this step deciding what to do about that. The Crown you came for went over the mountains while you were lying in my cellar.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Outwit 7 greater or equal
Custom Requirement=CActionExpression
