Node ID=50 her word
Text=A parcel that carries itself. <She works a ring off her hand: iron, a snake eating its tail.> Wear it where they can see it, and nothing of ours on the road north will touch you; it says you are already his. Past Montaillou it is his country, and I do not speak for him. Go. You are the last thing I was told to send, and then I can leave this place.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=<Take the ring.>
