Node ID=51 she refuses
Text=<She looks at you for the first time.> No. I have no wagons left, no sisters to spare, and a body is simpler to account for than a courier. You are the sixth thing to walk in here and ask me for the road.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Speech moreequal 50
Reply Text=You need a courier more than you need a corpse. North is your road too, and you cannot walk it.
Go to node ID=52 she weighs you
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=Outwit 9 greater or equal
Reply Text=Whole, and north. Those were your words. Not cold, and not here.
Go to node ID=53 her own orders
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=Barter moreequal 50
Reply Text=Then name the cargo and name the price. I will carry it and you keep your hands.
Go to node ID=54 the trade
Icon=Barter Skill Icon

